+ and an extra $11,250 catch-up for ages 60–63. But honestly, anything is better than nothing, so just start somewhere.\"}]]}],\"$L39\",\"$L3a\"]}]]}]\n34:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-xl border border-border/30 bg-card/50 p-6 sm:p-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mb-4\",\"children\":\"Related Articles\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L10\",\"2026-federal-tax-brackets-explained\",{\"href\":\"/blog/2026-federal-tax-brackets-explained\",\"className\":\"group rounded-lg border border-border/30 bg-card/60 p-4 hover:border-emerald-500/30 hover:bg-emerald-500/5 transition-all\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors mb-1\",\"children\":\"2026 Tax Brackets: IRS Income Tax Brackets 2026 Explained\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed line-clamp-2\",\"children\":\"Complete guide to the IRS 2026 tax brackets — income tax brackets 2026, marginal tax rate, federal income tax rates, adjusted gross income, and tax credits for married couples filing jointly.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L10\",\"how-fica-taxes-work-2026\",{\"href\":\"/blog/how-fica-taxes-work-2026\",\"className\":\"group rounded-lg border border-border/30 bg-card/60 p-4 hover:border-emerald-500/30 hover:bg-emerald-500/5 transition-all\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors mb-1\",\"children\":\"How FICA Taxes Work in 2026\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed line-clamp-2\",\"children\":\"Understanding FICA taxes (Social Security and Medicare) in 2026 — what you pay, what your employer pays, and how self-employment tax differs.\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n35:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-xl